# Full Stack Portfolio Website

## 📌 Project Overview

This is a Full Stack Personal Portfolio Website developed to showcase my skills, projects, certifications, and experience as a Frontend Developer and Computer Science student.

The project integrates both frontend and backend technologies along with a MongoDB database for handling contact form submissions.

# 🚀 Live Project

https://usershruthi23.github.io/portfolio-fullstack/

# 🛠️ Technologies Used

## Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* Bootstrap Icons
* Responsive Design

## Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js

## Database

* MongoDB Atlas
* Mongoose

## Deployment

* GitHub Pages (Frontend)
* Render (Backend)

# ✨ Features

* Responsive Portfolio Website
* Mobile Friendly Navigation
* Hero Section with Typing Effect
* About Section
* Skills Section
* Projects Showcase
* Internship Experience Section
* Certifications Section
* Contact Form Validation
* Backend API Integration
* MongoDB Database Storage
* Scroll To Top Button
* Active Navigation Highlighting


