# ⚙️ Backend Setup

## 1. Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Usershruthi23/portfolio-fullstack.git
```

## 2. Open Backend Folder

```bash
cd backend
```

## 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

## 4. Create .env File

```env
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
PORT=5000
```

## 5. Start Server

```bash
node server.js
```

Run the project using Live Server extension in VS Code.


# 📡 API Endpoint

## Contact Form API

```bash
POST /api/contact
```

### Sample Request

```json
{
  "name": "Shruthi",
  "email": "shruthi@gmail.com",
  "message": "Hello Backend"
}
```
# 🗄️ Database

All contact form messages are stored in MongoDB Atlas database using Mongoose.

